' v1.2's Options by keys (`OptionsScene`, `OptionsSavesPage`,
' `OptionsGiveUpPage`; `preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`, in
' Paradise Camp). O opens it on the Saves page with `[NEW SAVE]` focused;
' Space saves a new game under the next `<player>-saveNNN` and marks it
' (`OnSave`, `RefreshSaveGames(changed)`); Down past the last row goes to
' LOAD/SAVE/DELETE, Right and Left move along them, Up goes back to the
' rows; Space on SAVE with the new save marked writes over it. Tab goes to
' the tabs, Down moves along them and shows each page (Jukebox too: v1.2
' enables it whenever a music set is on disk, music off or not,
' `OptionsScene.cs:97`), Left enters Give up, Up and Down move between
' its two lines; Back closes the scene. A scripted run writes no time, so
' the rows show none (`clock` asks for one).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press o                  ' Options, the Saves page
wait 5
press space              ' [NEW SAVE]: gregory-save001, marked
wait 10
press down               ' the save's row
press down               ' past the last: the actions, on LOAD
press right              ' SAVE
press space              ' over the marked save
wait 10
press up                 ' back to the rows
press tab                ' the tabs, on Saves
press down               ' Jukebox (music off, but on disk)
press down               ' Settings
press down               ' Give up
press left               ' its page: Start new game
press down               ' Exit
press up                 ' Start new game
press escape             ' Back: the scene closes
wait 5
quit
